    "detailed_description": "Isla Sinaloa is a relaxing game full of activities to enjoy on a peaceful island in a universe full of friendly animals<br />\r\n<br />\r\nKEY FEATURES<br />\r\n<br />\r\n- Ride a dolphin and go up in a hot air balloon<br />\r\n- Explore labyrinths, underground temples, mines and volcanic caves<br />\r\n- Run a farm with crop management and cows and chickens<br />\r\n- 50+ mini-games including a food truck that you get to run<br />\r\n- Over 30 animal characters to get to know and become friends with<br />\r\n- Over 500+ items to collect and donate for island building exhibits<br />\r\n- Beautiful and vibrant zoo, museum and botanical gardens<br />\r\n- Customize your character with 100s of outfit and character combinations<br />\r\n- 100s of craftable items to decorate your island and home<br />\r\n- Many holidays are celebrated on your island<br />\r\n- You can share your island with your friends<br />\r\n- Full of love and little surprises!",
    "about_the_game": "Isla Sinaloa is a relaxing game full of activities to enjoy on a peaceful island in a universe full of friendly animals<br />\r\n<br />\r\nKEY FEATURES<br />\r\n<br />\r\n- Ride a dolphin and go up in a hot air balloon<br />\r\n- Explore labyrinths, underground temples, mines and volcanic caves<br />\r\n- Run a farm with crop management and cows and chickens<br />\r\n- 50+ mini-games including a food truck that you get to run<br />\r\n- Over 30 animal characters to get to know and become friends with<br />\r\n- Over 500+ items to collect and donate for island building exhibits<br />\r\n- Beautiful and vibrant zoo, museum and botanical gardens<br />\r\n- Customize your character with 100s of outfit and character combinations<br />\r\n- 100s of craftable items to decorate your island and home<br />\r\n- Many holidays are celebrated on your island<br />\r\n- You can share your island with your friends<br />\r\n- Full of love and little surprises!",
    "short_description": "Isla Sinaloa is a relaxing game full of puzzles and activities to enjoy on a peaceful island in a universe full of friendly animals",
